# Problem 1: Find Duplicate Emails

### Table

| email                             |
| --------------------------------- |
| [a@gmail.com](mailto:a@gmail.com) |
| [b@gmail.com](mailto:b@gmail.com) |
| [a@gmail.com](mailto:a@gmail.com) |

---

### Question

Find duplicate emails.

---

## Thinking Process

Need:

```text
Group rows
Count occurrences
```

Tool:

```text
GROUP BY + HAVING
```

---

## Query

```sql
SELECT email
FROM users
GROUP BY email
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;
```

---

## How to Remember

```text
Duplicates
=
GROUP BY
+
HAVING COUNT > 1
```

---

# Problem 2: Find Second Highest Salary

### Table

| salary |
| ------ |
| 50000  |
| 60000  |
| 70000  |

---

## Thinking

Highest salary:

```text
70000
```

Need next highest.

---

## Query

```sql
SELECT MAX(salary)
FROM employees
WHERE salary <
(
  SELECT MAX(salary)
  FROM employees
);
```

---

## Mental Model

```text
Find highest

Ignore it

Find highest again
```

---

# Problem 3: Employees Above Average Salary

### Thinking

Need:

```text
Employee salary

Compared with

Average salary
```

---

## Query

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE salary >
(
 SELECT AVG(salary)
 FROM employees
);
```

---

## Recognition Pattern

Whenever question says:

```text
Above average
Below average
```

Think:

```text
Aggregate + Subquery
```

---

# Problem 4: Count Employees Per Department

### Table

| name | department |
| ---- | ---------- |
| A    | CSE        |
| B    | CSE        |
| C    | ECE        |

---

## Question

Count employees in each department.

---

## Query

```sql
SELECT department,
COUNT(*)
FROM employees
GROUP BY department;
```

---

## Mental Model

```text
Per department

= GROUP BY department
```

---

# Problem 5: Students With No Course

Tables:

Students

Courses

---

Need:

```text
Students without match
```

---

## Query

```sql
SELECT s.*
FROM students s
LEFT JOIN enrollments e
ON s.id = e.student_id
WHERE e.student_id IS NULL;
```

---

## Recognition Pattern

Question says:

```text
Without
No Match
Not Assigned
Missing
```

Immediately think:

```text
LEFT JOIN
+
IS NULL
```

